{gold|Stack Experience:}
Enemy hero spells cost 1/2/3 extra mana from ranks 3/6/10. Regrowth reaches Basic/Advanced/Expert at ranks 4/7/10; spell power per creature increases from 1 to 1.25/1.5/1.75/2 at ranks 3/5/7/9 (total rounded down). Six casts per battle; guardian count unchanged.

Ophrys grants both Mandrakes +5 HP and both vine types +1 Speed and melee First Strike.

