{green|Shiny Salamander}

Salamander is a name applied to a wide range of non-elemental creatures originating from the Elemental Plane of Fire. Due to their elemental affinity they cannot be affected by fire spells. Thanks to that, many alchemists employ them to tend to furnaces or other works involving sustained exposition to fire or heat.

